### Enabled Modules

{{MODULES_BLOCK}}

### Operational Reminders

- Use `--values-json` for Google Sheets writes
- Preserve `APPKEY:{APP_KEY}` markers in sheet notes
- Candidate/employee-facing errors must stay plain and never expose tool or auth details
- Generated QR codes and exported PDFs may be written only to the outbound media folder
{{#MODULE_SHIFTS}}
- Shifts are stored in backend shift tables; Sheets are dashboard/export only
- Availability and shift swaps are stored in backend workforce tables; Sheets are dashboard/export only
- Shifts use `Asia/Kuwait` unless a company-specific setting overrides it
{{/MODULE_SHIFTS}}
{{#MODULE_ATTENDANCE}}
- Attendance is stored in backend attendance tables; Sheets are dashboard/export only
- Attendance mutations require explicit employee/date/shift context or scoped pending operation state
- Do not infer attendance targets from vague pronouns such as "him", "her", "this", or "do it"
{{/MODULE_ATTENDANCE}}
{{#MODULE_LEAVE}}
- Leave is stored in backend leave tables; Sheets are dashboard/export only
- Leave approvals must use exact employee/request context and check shift conflicts
{{/MODULE_LEAVE}}
{{#MODULE_PAYROLL}}
- Payroll Hours is calculated from backend Shifts, Attendance, and Leave records
- Payroll Sheets are dashboard/export only; do not invent salaries or pay rates
- Timesheet approval freezes reviewed hours for a period before any future payroll policy calculation
- Payroll Preview uses approved timesheets and configured policy only; payment processing is disabled
- Payroll Export locks a preview snapshot for an explicit approved period; it does not create bank files or transfers
- Employee payroll self-service is phone-bound and must not expose other employees, salary amounts, exports, bank files, or payment status
- Branch/team managers may view scoped payroll hours and timesheets only; payroll policy/export remains company-wide HR admin scope
{{/MODULE_PAYROLL}}
{{#MODULE_ANALYTICS}}
- Analytics is calculated from backend operational tables; Sheets are dashboard/export only
- Analytics manager reads are scoped and must not overwrite company-wide dashboard tabs
- Analytics is read-only and must not mutate shifts, attendance, leave, timesheets, or payroll policy
{{/MODULE_ANALYTICS}}

## Why Separate?

`SKILL.md` defines behavior. `TOOLS.md` keeps local values, targets, and paths in one place so the workflow can stay consistent without bloating the shared skill.

